{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["香柏樹的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["第十一年三月一日，耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要對埃及王法老和他的百姓說，",{"text":"「『誰能比你強大呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，亞述曾是黎巴嫩的一棵香柏樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝繁葉茂，遮天蔽日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高聳入雲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水源滋潤它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深泉使它茁壯成長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"溪流四圍環繞它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"澆灌著林間的樹木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豐沛的水源使它高過田間所有的樹木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝子長得又粗又長。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的飛鳥都在它的枝頭上搭窩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田間的野獸都在它的枝條下生產，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的大國都住在它的蔭下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它高大美麗，枝幹修長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為樹根深入豐沛的水源，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"連上帝園中的香柏樹也不能與它相比。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松樹不能與它的枝幹相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"楓樹不能與它的枝條相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝園中的樹木沒有一棵能與它媲美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使它枝繁葉茂，美麗無比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致上帝伊甸園裡的樹木都羡慕它。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「因此，主耶和華說，『因為它樹幹高大，樹梢高聳入雲，心高氣傲，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我要把它交在列國的首領手裡，他必按照它的邪惡懲治它。我丟棄了它。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["列邦中最殘暴的人要把它砍倒，丟棄在那裡，它折斷的枝幹散落在山間和河谷中。世上各族都離開它的蔭下，棄他而去，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["天上的飛禽要棲身在那折斷的樹幹上，地上的走獸要躺臥在它的枝條中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["故此，水邊的樹木都不再傲然矗立，高聳入雲，水源充足的大樹也不再如此高大，因為它們都註定要與下墳墓的人一同死亡，落到陰間的深處。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["「主耶和華說，『它下到陰間的那天，我要使哀聲響起，使深淵閉塞，江河止息，洪水停滯。我要使黎巴嫩為它哀哭，田野的樹木都因它而枯萎。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我將它與下墳墓的人一同拋到陰間時，列國聽見它墜落的響聲，都恐懼顫抖。伊甸園中的樹木和黎巴嫩水源充足的上好樹木都在陰間得到安慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["列國中活在它蔭庇下的爪牙都與它一同墜入陰間，到喪身刀下的人那裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["「『伊甸園的樹木中，誰能與你的威榮相比呢？然而你必與伊甸園的樹木一同下到陰間，躺臥在未受割禮的人當中，與喪身刀下的人在一起。 「『這就是法老和他百姓的結局。這是主耶和華說的。』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}